  "pa": {
    "title": "Privacy Policy & Credits (PA)",
    "effectiveDate": "Effective Date: [Today's Date]",
    "welcome": "Welcome to Routripo (\"we,\" \"our,\" or \"us\"). We are deeply committed to protecting your privacy, securing your data, and ensuring a transparent user experience. This comprehensive Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, safeguard, and manage your information when you use our mobile application.",
    "h1": "1. Information We Collect",
    "p1": "To provide you with an optimal travel planning experience, we may collect the following types of information:",
    "l1_1": "- User-Provided Data: When you use our app, you may create trip itineraries, enter expense details, and generate packing lists. This data is voluntarily provided by you.",
    "l1_2": "- Location and Search Data: We do NOT track your device's continuous background location. However, when you use our mapping and navigation feature (\"Dost Nakasha\"), the specific place names or coordinates you search for are processed to provide accurate routing and map displays.",
    "l1_3": "- Device Information: We may collect non-personal device information such as operating system version and app usage diagnostics to improve app performance and fix bugs.",
    "h2": "2. How We Use Your Information",
    "p2": "We use the collected data strictly for the following purposes:",
    "l2_1": "- To operate, maintain, and provide the core features of the App (e.g., Trip Planning, Budget Splitter).",
    "l2_2": "- To calculate accurate driving routes, distances, and estimated fuel/toll costs.",
    "l2_3": "- To provide live flight tracking information and in-app media/entertainment.",
    "l2_4": "- To improve user experience and optimize application performance.",
    "h3": "3. Data Storage & Security (We Do Not Sell Your Data)",
    "p3": "We strictly do not sell, rent, trade, or monetize your personal data to any third parties under any circumstances.",
    "l3_1": "- Local Storage First: Most of your personal travel data, expense records, and itineraries are stored locally on your device (using localStorage or IndexedDB).",
    "l3_2": "- Security Measures: We implement industry-standard encryption and security protocols to protect any data transmitted to cloud databases (if applicable).",
    "h4": "4. Third-Party Services & Data Sharing",
    "p4": "In order to provide premium features completely free of charge, Routripo integrates with highly respected, open-source third-party APIs. When utilizing these features, your IP address and specific search queries may be processed by these independent services:",
    "l4_1": "- Mapping & Geocoding: We use OpenStreetMap (OSM) and the Nominatim API for location searches.",
    "l4_2": "- Routing: We use the Open Source Routing Machine (OSRM) to calculate paths.",
    "l4_3": "- Flight Tracking: We fetch live airspace data using The OpenSky Network.",
    "l4_4": "- Media & Audio: We utilize public, open-source API instances (such as unofficial JioSaavn/Invidious wrappers) to provide in-app music and video searches.",
    "p4_2": "These third-party services operate as independent data controllers and are governed by their respective privacy policies.",
    "h5": "5. Open-Source Attributions & Credits",
    "p5": "We proudly acknowledge and support the open-source community that empowers our application. The following credits are mandated and proudly displayed:",
    "l5_1": "- Map Data: © OpenStreetMap contributors. Map data is available under the Open Database License.",
    "l5_2": "- Routing Technology: Powered by OSRM (Open Source Routing Machine).",
    "l5_3": "- Geocoding Services: Data provided by Nominatim API.",
    "l5_4": "- Flight Radar: Live flight data provided by The OpenSky Network (https://opensky-network.org).",
    "h6": "6. Device Permissions Justification",
    "p6": "To fully utilize the app, we may request the following specific device permissions:",
    "l6_1": "- Camera & Storage Access: Requested only if you use the expense tracking feature to scan, capture, or save images of your bills locally on your device.",
    "l6_2": "- Internet / Network Access: Required to fetch live map tiles, calculate routes, track flights, and stream media content from our third-party open-source providers.",
    "p6_2": "(You can revoke these permissions at any time via your device settings, though some app features may cease to function correctly).",
    "h7": "7. Children's Privacy (COPPA Compliance)",
    "p7": "Our App is not intended for, nor designed to attract, children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from anyone under 13. If you are a parent or guardian and discover that your child has provided us with personal data, please contact us immediately so we can remove that information from our systems.",
    "h8": "8. Your Rights & Data Deletion",
    "p8": "You retain complete control over your data.",
    "l8_1": "- You can manually delete individual trip details, scanned bills, and expense histories directly within the app interface at any time.",
    "l8_2": "- Because core data is stored locally, simply clearing the app's cache/data in your device settings or uninstalling the app will permanently and irrevocably delete all your locally stored information.",
    "h9": "9. Changes to This Privacy Policy",
    "p9": "We reserve the right to update or modify this Privacy Policy at any time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated \"Effective Date\". We encourage you to review this policy periodically. Your continued use of the app after any changes signifies your acceptance of the updated terms.",
    "h10": "10. Contact Us",
    "p10": "If you have any questions, concerns, or feedback regarding this Privacy Policy, the open-source credits, or our data practices, please do not hesitate to contact us at:",
    "contactEmail": "Email: shrd.raut@gmail.com",
    "closeBtn": "I Understand & Close"
  },
